# ===========================================================================
# TrustFlow (N-Cash) — .gitignore
# Stack: .NET 10 / ASP.NET Core / PostgreSQL / Vanilla HTML+CSS+JS
# ===========================================================================


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ⚠️  SECURITY — NEVER COMMIT CREDENTIALS
# The real appsettings files contain DB passwords and JWT secrets.
# Use environment variables or user secrets for local/prod config.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Uncomment the line below ONLY if you store real secrets in appsettings.json.
# For this hackathon repo the file is intentionally kept (judges need it).
appsettings.json
appsettings.*.json
!appsettings.json
!appsettings.Development.json


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# .NET BUILD ARTIFACTS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

## Build output directories (every project)
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/

## Publish output
[Pp]ublish/
publish/

## NuGet packages restored locally
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
.nuget/
packages/
nuget.config.local

## NuGet lock files (these are fine to commit if you use lock-mode)
# packages.lock.json

## MSBuild binary logs
*.binlog

## MSBuild incremental build caches
*.Up2Date
*.cache

## Generated source files
*.AssemblyInfo.cs
*.GlobalUsings.g.cs
*.AssemblyInfoInputs.cache
*.genruntimeconfig.cache
*.GeneratedMSBuildEditorConfig.editorconfig
*.FileListAbsolute.txt
*.CoreCompileInputs.cache
*.AssemblyReference.cache

## Test results
TestResults/
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage-report/

## Code coverage artifacts
**/.coverage/


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VISUAL STUDIO / RIDER / VS CODE IDE FILES
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

## Visual Studio
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.rsuser

## Rider
.idea/
*.sln.iml

## VS Code
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/tasks.json

## JetBrains
*.DotSettings.user

## Resharper
_ReSharper*/
*.ReSharper

## NCrunch
*.ncrunch*
_NCrunch_*/

## SonarQube / Coverlet
.sonarqube/


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ASP.NET CORE — RUNTIME & SECRETS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

## dotnet user secrets
**/secrets.json
%APPDATA%/Microsoft/UserSecrets/

## HTTPS dev certificate (Windows)
*.pfx

## Entity Framework migrations snapshot temp files (keep actual migration files)
# Migrations/ — keep, these are source-controlled

## Static file publishing manifest
bundleconfig.json.bak

## Hot reload temp files
.hotreload/


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OPERATING SYSTEM NOISE
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

## Windows
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk

## macOS
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

## Linux
*~


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LOGS & DIAGNOSTICS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
logs/
*.pid
*.seed


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FRONTEND (wwwroot)
# Static HTML/CSS/JS are source files — keep them all.
# Only exclude generated/minified build artefacts if you add a build step.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

## If you add a bundler (Webpack/Vite/esbuild) in the future:
# wwwroot/dist/
# wwwroot/build/
# node_modules/
# .parcel-cache/
# .cache/


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DOCKER (future use)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.dockerignore.local
docker-compose.override.yml


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# KEEP THESE (explicit allow-list overrides)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

## Solution and project files
!NCash.slnx
!*.csproj

## Source configuration (kept intentionally for hackathon — change for prod)
!appsettings.json
!appsettings.Development.json

## Hackathon brief documents
!*.pdf
!*.txt

## Documentation
!docs/
!README.md
